low.func.def target<amdgpu.gfx11.generic.core>(@target) abi(hal_kernel) @cfg_binary_search_retains_narrow_index_carrier(%choose_upper: reg<amdgpu.sgpr x2>, %reference_length: reg<amdgpu.vgpr>) -> (reg<amdgpu.vgpr>) asm {
